repository-code: https://github.com/gufranco/snes-rtc-python
url: https://github.com/gufranco/snes-rtc-python
abstract: >-
  A model of the two real time clocks that shipped in Super Nintendo cartridges,
  the Sharp S-RTC and the Epson RTC-4513. Both carry their own calendar rules,
  their own register layouts, and their own idea of what a stopped clock does,
  and both are settled against a reference implementation rather than against the
  calendar the host machine happens to keep.
keywords:
  - emulation
  - super-nintendo
  - s-rtc
  - rtc-4513
  - real-time-clock
  - hardware-model
  - conformance
